WEBVTT

00:09:59.453 --> 00:10:00.720
and these become T cells.

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.672
But it's really hard, once you ski down,

00:10:02.672 --> 00:10:04.195
to get back up.

00:10:04.195 --> 00:10:09.607
Unless, of course, if you have a ski lift.

00:10:09.607 --> 00:10:12.056
And what those four chemicals do

00:10:12.056 --> 00:10:14.125
is they take any cell

00:10:14.125 --> 00:10:16.057
and take it way back up the mountain

00:10:16.057 --> 00:10:18.090
so it can become any body part.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.818
And as you think of that,

00:10:19.818 --> 00:10:21.798
what it means is potentially

00:10:21.798 --> 00:10:23.973
you can rebuild a full copy

00:10:23.973 --> 00:10:25.840
of any organism

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:28.426
out of any one of its cells.

00:10:28.426 --> 00:10:30.957
That turns out to be a big deal